<title>UK: World Bank sets 150 million rand one-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 150 million rand one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.75     MATURITY    30.APR.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.875   PAY DATE    30.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.75	PRAECIPUUM  0.10</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF GLOBAL MULTI-CURRENCY PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
